  "description": "The Bergamont E-Ville is a lightweight urban bike with a low step-over height and a compact yet powerful Bosch Performance Line SX electric drive system.\n\nIt’s the perfect companion to get around town for all ages and genders. The E-Ville model range features superior riding characteristics thanks to modern manufacturing processes like an investment casting of the central flange for best possible rigidity to weight ratio and perfect component integration. This core piece of technology also doubles as a handle if you need to carry your E-Ville.\n\nThe Bosch CompactTube battery integrated into the frame can be easily removed for remote charging. With the Bosch Smart System advanced connectivity features and upgrades are available: use the eBike Flow App to control your bike or add optional extras like a Bosch PowerMore battery for increased range or a Bosch ConnectModule for GPS tracking.",
